<title>DUBAI: Dubai silver re-exports to India double in April.</title>
<headline>Dubai silver re-exports to India double in April.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Silver re-exports from Dubai in the United Arab Emirates to India climbed to 95.19 tonnes in April from 47.81 tonnes in March, according to figures compiled by the statistics section of Dubai customs.</p>
<p>Re-exports to Pakistan were down at 1.58 tonnes in April from 8.56 tonnes in March, the figures showed.</p>
</text>
